Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喲 原來你還在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直待在這裡會感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼好笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.63,0:01:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許 我還是和小泉這樣的傢伙比較合得來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去的時候 再去車站前的KTV唱歌吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.57,0:02:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次大谷說什麼或做什麼的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都會讓我置身天堂 或如下地獄
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的世界 開始圍繞著大谷旋轉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奪回我的愛！本命巧克力磨練少女心！！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 我已經被他拒絕過一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經沒什麼信心了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道小泉是不是又哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許 我還是和小泉這樣的傢伙比較合得來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.21,0:02:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到了那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:56.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像又讓我看到了希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是太菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乾脆去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又怎麼你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.02,0:03:04.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是叫你把邊對齊再訂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:05.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有對齊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 哪裡對齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.54,0:03:09.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看這個 根本就是亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.26,0:03:12.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很煩耶 囉囉嗦嗦的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.57,0:03:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟碎嘴的小姑一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是你太粗線條了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不拘小節
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.30,0:03:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 給我閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們兩個又在吵什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是老師讓他們準備下節自習課用的講義
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 人家好不容易整理好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.72,0:03:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷的心意 我完全摸不透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.55,0:03:43.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站在熱氣騰騰的湯鍋後面的拉麵店老闆 迷朦得看不清
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有更好的比喻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.84,0:03:49.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這就已經讓我想破頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 你們之間的氣氛很不錯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.39,0:04:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的確是在往右上方上升
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.21,0:04:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉在大谷同學心中的排名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.17,0:04:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.44,0:04:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你不是贏了神崎了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，現在開始要一鼓作氣 乘勝追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.68,0:04:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情人節馬上就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送巧克力給他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧克力啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.81,0:04:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 去年都沒送成
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.45,0:04:32.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萬一再像去年一樣被拒絕的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的要自暴自棄了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.48,0:04:41.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不會那樣講的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然你要眼睜睜地看著他收別人的巧克力嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.31,0:04:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不行啊 我喜歡大谷的事情已經被揭穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遮遮掩掩已經行不通了 豈不是要送本命巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:04:58.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都什麼時候了 你還想用人情巧克力來掩人耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送巧克力就好像重新告白一次 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由不得你 給我送
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:12.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙真是永遠都不冷場啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在好歹也是自習課啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去年的情人節 你有收過別人送的巧克力嗎	
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.40,0:05:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有收過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那些經常來看打籃球的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那幾個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.37,0:05:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過是人情巧克力罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.29,0:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:46.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一有新社員進來 她們就全都跑了 完全無視我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是無所謂啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再說 今年肯定會收到巧克力的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你會送我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什麼 我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不送給我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要 我想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你這麼想要的話 送給你也不是不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛擺出一副我求你的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.92,0:06:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近我一直都在收你的禮物耶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次我再一起還你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.49,0:06:34.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.26,0:06:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的話 我真的會有所期待的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.22,0:06:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道說 我們的感覺真的不錯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.14,0:07:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我要巧克力的意思難道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.66,0:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉學姐 好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙 聖子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來買東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.07,0:07:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家政部情人節要做巧克力 我們出來買材料
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.45,0:07:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉學姐要不要和我們一起做送給大谷學長的巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家一起做來分 比較便宜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.58,0:07:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說的也是 那就一起做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要送那個小不點 那我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.55,0:07:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會給啦 會給啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一副敷衍了事的樣子 我是順便的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:01.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼關係 阿遙學長的女朋友一定會送你的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.42,0:08:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有女朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 有7個
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.66,0:08:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,7個？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:11.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟不同的女生交往 把自己磨練成好男人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為了將來能和理莎交往
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次交一個就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.75,0:08:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生已經所剩無多了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道還有沒有90年可以活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經長命百歲了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和大谷學長怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在已經你儂我儂了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.74,0:08:34.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個…我還沒告訴你們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.97,0:08:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被拒絕了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼意思 他憑什麼拒絕理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.12,0:08:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是…他說他沒辦法把我當作女朋友看待
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.70,0:08:49.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛逼我說出來 害我又想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這怎麼可能 我要用吸塵器把那個矮冬瓜吸走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 人家都已經拒絕你了 你還要送巧克力？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.83,0:09:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那句‘人家都拒絕你了’真多餘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是事實如此啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他都已經拒絕你了 還不夠嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛還要送他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐你還是喜歡他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聖子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂嗎 我這顆酸楚的少女心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂！因為我也是少女啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 聖子郎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫我聖子 我是少女
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那種少女心 不必懂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 理莎 已經夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別再理那個拒絕你的人了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.49,0:09:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.36,0:09:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要多花點時間 我會讓他喜歡上我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.16,0:09:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 我們現在的感覺也還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.26,0:09:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐加油！我支持你！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你 我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 我絕對繞不了那個矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.45,0:10:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 就算要花上很長時間也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要著急
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.96,0:10:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這樣 一點一點地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓你變成我的俘虜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹～嘛～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好噁 你幹嘛那麼開心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:24.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看這個 海坊主要出專輯了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.74,0:10:26.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 那一定要買
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.68,0:10:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是說 最近要開演唱會了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對喔 哇 好高興哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.84,0:10:34.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是當然 不然我還要找誰去聽海坊主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.69,0:10:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要抓緊時間弄到票啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.53,0:10:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.62,0:11:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你幹什麼啊你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深川遙 英俊挺拔的17歲少年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是理莎的青梅竹馬…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒人問你這個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 阿遙 你幹嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.99,0:11:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 怎麼了 發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:14.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.23,0:11:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你這死矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢拒絕理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:25.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拒絕理莎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.10,0:11:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相聲組合決裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不像吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說 你什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不滿意理莎哪點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 阿遙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個…就是說…怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.51,0:11:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我幹嘛要跟你解釋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你拒絕了理莎 就別再接近她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你裝什麼情聖 玩弄人家女生的色狼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.22,0:11:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是那樣 混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然是怎…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:11:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.37,0:12:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你給我過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛好痛 為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的拒絕人家啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好過分
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:20.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明跟人家那麼要好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉好可憐哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.71,0:12:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們快說點什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是站在理莎這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.91,0:12:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是站在小信這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.28,0:12:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們算什麼朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:38.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你跑來管什麼閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為…那傢伙實在太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.42,0:12:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他甩了理莎 還沒事似的在那邊笑 跟白痴一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.55,0:12:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再沒神經也沒人像他那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠了 是我讓大谷這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:56.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我讓他不用顧慮我 跟以前一樣就好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說沒關係就沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要嘀嘀咕咕的 小心我啃你的頭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是為了理莎著想
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.25,0:13:09.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我知道 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要用我的方式 自己努力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就不要管我的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.84,0:13:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 我再也不管理莎了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學 真是太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:31.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個好女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷真是白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.87,0:13:36.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然拒絕小泉這麼好的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.57,0:13:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,過分 太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們先等一下 也聽聽我怎麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.82,0:13:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛才阿遙的事 你別放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.13,0:13:47.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都是站在小泉這邊的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同學 萬歲！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萬歲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:14:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…等一下 這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題 大家都為理莎加油
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.70,0:14:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就放心大膽地上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然搞不太清楚狀況 不過 我會好好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…真的很沒神經嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是玩弄少女心的情聖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:40.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有玩弄過別人了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 實際上你對小泉又是怎麼樣的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.08,0:14:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜歡她嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.26,0:14:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個嘛 一定要分喜歡或討厭的話 是喜歡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.77,0:14:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有要她當女朋友的意思嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是這一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很難講…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸？ 這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.39,0:15:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為 你說的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我不就要和小泉接吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不覺得很好笑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:23.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明就在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 害我出了一身冷汗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.88,0:15:31.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.27,0:15:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還以為 你們交往是遲早的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.34,0:15:36.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為大谷你跟小泉說的話 都好像對小泉有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.35,0:15:42.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.78,0:15:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是那個時候跟神崎說的話啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是小信聽到的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道小泉是不是又哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.30,0:15:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也許 我還是和小泉這樣的傢伙比較合得來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是心裡想什麼 就直接說出來而已
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.75,0:16:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是還跟人家要情人節巧克力了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想吃巧克力而已 沒別的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生的摧花浪子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的 才不是 別亂說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.70,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告訴你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.16,0:16:18.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你隨口一句無心的話 都比你自己想像的更讓小泉神魂顛倒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別…別說的這麼恐怖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.29,0:16:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:35.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集合！  是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.54,0:16:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會不會做得太多了點
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.33,0:16:57.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的還在社團活動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然早了一天 還是把剛做好的拿去送他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎也一塊去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然了 包裝都準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的要送給他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真囉嗦 別管我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.34,0:17:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 你就吃自己做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明明說要送我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.63,0:17:25.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 竟然要送那個矮冬瓜巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:27.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又不長個
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生的營養不良
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我好緊張
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.51,0:17:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去一下洗手間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,託阿遙的福 我現在更有幹勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會再遮遮掩掩的了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是如假包換的本命巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.15,0:18:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收下吧 大谷 收下我的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.84,0:18:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 這個氣氛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個 不是人情巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可…可不可以改為人情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是本命巧克力 你就不肯收了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.62,0:18:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己說要的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…話是沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是說
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你沒辦法接受我的心意？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 教練叫你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你到辦公室去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.47,0:18:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.25,0:19:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.92,0:19:03.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 打擾你們了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 快點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是親愛的 對大谷說了不該說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:20.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是不該說的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.71,0:19:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明對我沒意思 就不要對我這麼好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種漂亮話 我說不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 雖然你沒有那個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.03,0:19:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你對我好 我會更高興 更努力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.68,0:19:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好疼…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.93,0:19:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰叫我傻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給我收下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都說了 我不能收
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.71,0:20:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.27,0:20:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能抱著這種不確定的心態 收下你的本命巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個人很極端耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼這麼死硬派
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我並不認為大谷沒神經 也不認為你是情聖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.95,0:20:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷一點都沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怪 就該怪我自己 明明被拒絕了卻還沒辦法死心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.41,0:20:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 不管你是喜歡我還是討厭我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.79,0:20:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要說出你心中所想的就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.49,0:20:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總之 那個 收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 這是本命巧克力 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.15,0:20:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算要花很長時間也無所謂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你能慢慢喜歡上我 我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.11,0:21:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過我還真是被笨得無可救藥的人喜歡上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.03,0:21:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 你那是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你讓我想什麼就說什麼的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,話是沒錯…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這是故意整我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（矮冬瓜  白痴）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:28.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 我換掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能把理莎做的巧克力交給那種白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被情人節詛咒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.74,0:23:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,預告
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.84,0:23:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 你到我家來做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:24.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兩個人在大谷的房間獨處
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.78,0:23:26.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我什麼都不想做啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像個大叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.20,0:23:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛情結 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,發燒！在他房間裡的初吻？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.75,0:23:33.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看哦
